<view class="lx-page"><field-nav/><view class="lx-content"><view class="lx-kicker">FIELD INSIGHTS</view><view class="lx-title">场域精测</view><view class="lx-subtitle">输入你的生命信息，开启一次初始观测。<br/>场域将呈现与你相关的第一层生命结构。<br/>当你准备深入探索，可继续开启完整档案。</view><view class="flow"><text>初始观测</text><text>结构初读</text><text>完整档案</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="lx-loading">正在读取场域…</view><view wx:else class="lx-grid lx-section"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="productId" class="lx-card lx-veil" data-sku="{{item.skuId}}" data-product="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="open"><view class="lx-card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="lx-card-note">{{item.assessmentDescription || item.note}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.knowledgeNodes && item.knowledgeNodes.length}}" class="node-row"><text wx:for="{{item.knowledgeNodes}}" wx:for-item="node" wx:key="*this">{{node}}</text></view><view class="enter-test">{{item.assessmentCta || '开启初始观测 →'}}</view></view></view></view></view>
